  "notes": "Field-station instrument config tool styled like a careful lab notebook: warm off-white/stone greys, near-black top bar, single deep teal primary, amber for 'changed vs base profile' (amber cell fill + left rule + 'was 10 min') and warnings, red pill for calibration overdue. Live vs Draft profile pills joined by an arrow in the header frame the whole page as a staged diff; a grey 'Live now' column shows what loggers run today. Right aside reads like a pre-flight checklist with amber-left-ruled notes and a rationale textarea per change, ending in a sticky 'Schedule for Wed Dec 2, 09:00' button. Monospace for every measured value/unit. Bulk action bar (interval + Apply, Turn on/off) appears above the table on selection."
